{"unit_id":"FANLS05__dsh-desktop-notifications#card-zh","repo":"FANLS05/dsh-desktop-notifications","commit":"c53b2c5ba0aeb99071d25e8cd387c9e0b7041685","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notifications 是 DSH 桌面端的 Windows Toast 插件。它监听权限申请、用户提问、任务完成、执行错误和 DeepSeek 登录事件，弹出带会话名称的通知；子代理和工作流提醒可选开启。通知优先使用 Electron，随后由 PowerShell 调用 Windows Toast，并可退到系统托盘气泡。插件支持 Markdown 清理、消息截断与去重，可配置事件开关、延时和本地审计日志。适合希望及时处理 DSH 待办或查看运行状态的 Windows 用户，需要 Windows 与 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/impl.js:299","lib/impl.js:390","lib/impl.js:482","lib/impl.js:584","lib/toast.ps1:1"]}
{"unit_id":"FANLS05__dsh-desktop-notifications#card-en","repo":"FANLS05/dsh-desktop-notifications","commit":"c53b2c5ba0aeb99071d25e8cd387c9e0b7041685","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-notifications alerts DSH users on Windows about approvals, questions, completed runs, errors, and sign-in. Toasts include the conversation title. Delivery tries Electron, then PowerShell and Windows Toast with a tray fallback. Event switches, delays, and local logging are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/impl.js:299","lib/impl.js:390","lib/impl.js:482","lib/impl.js:584","lib/toast.ps1:1"]}
